Lua 5.4.7
Released 2024-06-13 by Lua.org, PUC-Rio.
Source: https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.4.7.tar.gz

Vendored for olyscript-g3 (issue #31). This is the upstream src/ tree with the
two standalone mains removed (lua.c, the interpreter; luac.c, the compiler);
olyscript-g3 supplies its own host main(). The single-TU build entry point is
onelua.c (MAKE_LIB mode). License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory).

Scripts target the Lua 5.1 common subset where practical, to preserve the
gopher-lua Go-portability path described in doc/scripting-tool.md §7.
